      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS CHAPO (2) produced a moderate run last time when sixth at Angle Park over 530m behind Lavender Lane (32.04) in a Grade 6. Placed at her previous run. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. BILLY BUST UP (4) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth at Angle Park, but was among the placings at Angle Park three back. Safe beginner but tricky box to overcome. Expected to bounce back to best. ZIPPING ALONSO (1) finished third (23.06) two back at Maitland but out of the placings last time when 7th there. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Should be about the money. LEKTRA LEE (8) has top-three aspirations after placing last time.",
